1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,997
Next spring, wide cells again, right next to the narrow ones.

2
00:00:03,997 --> 00:00:07,408
That sudden jump is the edge you see on a cut log.

3
00:00:07,408 --> 00:00:15,989
One band of spring wood plus the band of autumn wood after it makes one annual ring, or growth ring: one year's growth.

